    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Lūshikū lw'isangī",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 16:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ū SEEBA akalūngalūnga nū Musa aho baacha a bitūnja ba ng'wa Alooni, abo bakacha kūlwa nguno ya kwegeela kū būtongi bo ng'wa SEEBA. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.16.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.16.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 16:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ū SEEBA ūng'wīla ū Musa alīhaya, “Ng'wīlage ū nkūlūyo ū Alooni gīkī yaya ū kūja gīt'ūmo atogelilwe wei dūhū ū kū būtongi wa isumbī lya shigongo īlo līlī h'isandīko, kū mpīndo y'isenge, ū kwipandī ī lyeela no no no; ūlū wīta gīko akūcha. Nguno ū nene nakiyoolechaga mu nzīla ya ilunde a higūlya ya isumbī lya shigongo.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.16.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.16.2"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 16:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.16.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.16.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 16:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "“Ū Alooni ūlū aliza ū ng'wipandī ī lyeelya, shiigelile wize na shikolo īshi, nzagamba ya ng'ombe mūūga, kūlwa shitambò sha shibi, na ng'ondi kūlwa shitambò sha kūpemva. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.16.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.16.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 16:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nīyo azwaale ī ng'hanjo ya kitaani nū ng'wenda gwa kitaani ū gwa kūtonja mu gatī, nū ngwaasho gwa kitaani agwitunge ū mu nkīmbīlī gwakwe; nī ngoofiila ya kitaani īzwale. Ī shizwalo shenīshi shilī sheela, na lūūlū aho ataalī ū kūshizwaala, shiigelile ooge mu minzī tame. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.16.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.16.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 16:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Akūsola ngulyati ibīlī ja mbūli kūfuma ū kū Baisilaeli; īmò kūlwa shitambò sha shibi, yīngī ya shitambò sha kūpemva.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.16.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.16.5"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 16:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.16.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.16.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 16:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "“Ū Alooni akwīfunya ī nzagamba kūbiza shitambò kūlwa shibi shakwe, abeeje isangī kūlwa nguno yakwe nī kaya yakwe. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.16.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.16.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 16:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hanuma ya henaho ū Alooni akūjisola nī mbūli ūjeenha kū būtongi bo ng'wa SEEBA, ha nyango gwiheema lya kwibilingīla. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.16.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.16.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 16:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hūna ūjeesela mbale; mbūlī īmò yūbiza kūlwa ng'wa SEEBA, ī yīngī yūbiza ya kūsaamya būbi.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.16.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.16.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "f",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16:8",
              "type": "text"
            },
            {
              "text": "Ya kūsaamya būbi:",
              "type": "text"
            },
            {
              "text": "Nūūlū, ya kūtwalwa kūlī Azazeeli.",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.16.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.16.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 16:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ī mbūli īyo īlagwīlwe mbale gīkī ībize kūlwa nguno ya ng'wa SEEBA, ū Alooni akūyenha wīfunye kūlwa shitambò sha shibi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.16.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.16.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 16:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Īyo īlaasolwe kūbiza ya kūsaamya būbi, īkūfunyiwa kūlwa ng'wa SEEBA īlī mhanga gīko, ītūmamīlwe kūbeeja isangī mu nzīla ya kūtwalwa kwitogolo kūlwa kūsaamya būbi.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.16.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.16.10"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Kafunīje ka shitambò",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 16:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.16.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.16.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 16:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "“Hūna ū Alooni akūyenha ī nzagamba ya shitambò sha shibi kūlwa nguno yakwe; akwīsīnza wīfunya kūlwa shibi shakwe, ūbeeja isangī kūlwa nguno yakwe nī kaya yakwe. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.16.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.16.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 16:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hanuma ya henaho akūsola lyahulīlo, ahule makala ga moto kūfuma ha ng'walīlo, kū būtongi bo ng'wa SEEBA; ūdaha na mapī abīlī ga būbbani wa ng'waso gwawiza būshiwe chiza būnojiwa. Ī shose shenīshi akūja nasho ū kū mpīndo y'isenge. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.16.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.16.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 16:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ū būbbani ūbūtūūla a ha moto kū būtongi bo ng'wa SEEBA; ī lyochi īlo līladundumūke līkūlīshīīkīja ī lisumbī lya shigongo īlo līlī h'isandīko lya būkaanīji, atizūcha. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.16.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.16.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 16:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "A mininga ga nzagamba akūsola magehu ūgaseeseebela na lwala lwakwe ha būtongi w'isumbī lya shigongo; gangī ūsaamagūla na lwala lwakwe ng'hangala mpungatī ū kū būtongi walyo ī lisumbī lya shigongo.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.16.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.16.14"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 16:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.16.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.16.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 16:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "“Hanuma ya henaho akwīsīnza ī mbūli ya shitambò sha shibi īyo yafunyiagwa na banhū; a mininga gayo ūgatwala ū kū mpīndo y'isenge, kwīta gīt'ūmo wagīītīlaga a ga nzagamba, ūlīseeseebela ī lisumbī lya shigongo a ha būtongi walyo, gangī ūgasaamagūlīla ū kū būtongi walyo. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.16.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.16.15"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 16:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ī lipandī īlo līlī lyeela no no no akūlībeegeja isangī mu nzīla yenīyo, kūlwa nguno ya būsoso wa Baisilaeli na būshitiigwa wabo, nūūlū shibi shingī na shingī īsho bakūbiza bashīta. Akūlyītī gīko nī liheema lya kwibilingīla, īlo līlī hamò nabo, mu būsoso wabo. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.16.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.16.16"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 16:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ū ng'wiheema lya kwibilingīla atizūbizamo munhū nūūlū ūmò, kwandīja ikanza īlo Alooni alingīlīle kūbeeja isangī ng'wipandī lyeela no no no, kūshisha afume mo; ūlū wamala kūbeeja isangī kūlwa nguno yakwe wei ng'wenekīlī nī kaya yakwe, na a Baisilaeli a bose.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.16.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.16.17"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 16:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.16.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.16.17"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "18",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 16:18"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "18",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "“Hūna akūfuma, wiza a ha ng'walīlo ūyo gūlī kū būtongi bo ng'wa SEEBA, nago ūgūbeegeja isangī; ūsola mininga gamò a ga nzagamba na a ga mbūlī ūgabila pye a mapembe ga ng'walīlo gwenūyo. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.16.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.16.18"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "19",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 16:19"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "19",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Gamò ga mininga genayo ūgūsaamagūlīla ū ng'walīlo gwenūyo na lwala lwakwe ng'hangala mpungatī kūlwa kūgweeja, gwele ū būsoso wa Baisilaeli.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.16.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.16.19"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "19",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 16:19"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "19",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.16.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.16.19"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "20",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 16:20"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "20",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "“Ū Alooni ūlū ūmala ū kūbeeja ī lisangī kūlwa nguno ya ipandī lyeela no no no, nī liheema lya kwibilingīla, nū ng'walīlo, akūyenha nī mbūlī ī mhanga. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.16.20",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.16.20"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "21",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 16:21"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "21",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ūtūūla a makono gakwe būbīlī wago a ha ntwe gwa mbūlī ī mhanga yenīyo, ūbūtambūūla ū būbi wa Baisilaeli ū bose, nū būshitiigwa wabo, pyī ī shibi shabo, ūshitūūla ha ntwe gwayo ī mbūlī yenīyo. Hūna wītūūla mu nkono gwa munhū ūyo ahelilwe kūlwa nīmo gwenūyo, wītwaala kū matogolo. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.16.21",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.16.21"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "22",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 16:22"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "22",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ī mbūlī yenīyo īkūshibūūcha pyī ī shibi shabo, yūja nasho kū matogolo, ūko batīko banhū; ū munhū ng'wenūyo akūīleka kū matogolo kwenūko ī mbūli yenīyo.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.16.22",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.16.22"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "22",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 16:22"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "22",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.16.22",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.16.22"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "23",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 16:23"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "23",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "“Hūna ū Alooni akwingīla ū ng'wiheema lya kwibilingīla, ūshizuula ī shizwalo sha kitaani īsho walī wazwalaga aho ataalī kwingīla ū ng'wipandī lyeela no no no, ūshileka ng'wenūmo ī shizwalo shenīsho. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.16.23",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.16.23"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "24",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 16:24"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "24",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ū wei ūja kwipandī lyeela kooga mu minzī, ūzwaala nī shizwalo īsho akatūmamīlaga na kale. Hūna ūja hanze kūfunya shitambò sha kūpemva kūlwa nguno yakwe, na shitambò sha kūpemva kūlwa banhū bose; ūbeeja isangī kūlwa nguno yakwe, na a banhū a bangī pye a bose. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.16.24",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.16.24"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "25",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 16:25"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "25",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Na a masazu ga shitambò sha shibi ūgapemba a ha ng'walīlo.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.16.25",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.16.25"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "25",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 16:25"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "25",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.16.25",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.16.25"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "26",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 16:26"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "26",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "“Ū munhū ūyo walī watwaalaga mbūli kū matogolo kūlwa kūsaamya būbi, akūfula ī shizwalo shakwe, ooga nū mīlī gwakwe mu minzī, hūna wigeleelwa kwiza ū mu ng'hambī. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.16.26",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.16.26"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "27",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 16:27"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "27",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ī nzagamba ya shitambò sha shibi nī mbūli ya shitambò sha shibi, ī mitugo ījo mininga gaajo gaalī genhagwa ng'wipandī lyeela no no no kūlwa kūbeeja isangī, shiigelile jitwalwe hanze ya ng'hambī kūpemva mu moto, a makūnza gaajo nī nyama, pyī nū būūshi wajo. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.16.27",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.16.27"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "28",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 16:28"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "28",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ū munhū ūyo alīshipemba nang'hwe akūfula ī shizwalo shakwe, nū wei ooga mu minzī ū mīlī gwakwe, hūna wiza ū mu ng'hambī.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.16.28",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.16.28"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Shilagīlo sha shikū jose",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "28",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 16:28"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "28",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.16.28",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.16.28"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "29",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 16:29"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "29",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "“Ī shilagīlo shenīshi shilī shing'we mushidime shikū jose; ū mu lūshikū lw'ikūmi lwa ng'weji gwa mpungatī, būlī ūmò wing'we wileche ī sha kūyeja mīlī gwakwe; nūūlū atizigela ose ose wa kūtūmama milīmo, abize myalīlwa mu sī ying'we, nūūlū ngeni ūyo akwikalaga hamò ning'we. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.16.29",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.16.29"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "30",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 16:30"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "30",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nguno ū mu lūshikū lwenūlo līkūbeejiwa isangī kūlwa nguno ying'we, kūlwa kwejiwa kwing'we; mubize beela kūlī SEEBA; mukwejiwa pyī ī shibi shing'we. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.16.30",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.16.30"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "31",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 16:31"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "31",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ū lūshikū lyenūlo īlī Sabato ya kwifuula kwing'we; alīyo shiigeleelilwe kwilecha ī ya kūyeja mīlī; ī shenīshi shilī shilagīlo sha būja na būja, shidimagi shikū jose. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.16.31",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.16.31"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "32",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 16:32"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "32",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ū ngabīji ūyo witīīlwa maguta, ūyo ahelilwe kūdima nīmo gwa būgabīji a ha ng'wanya go ng'wa ise, h'ūyo akūshizwaala ī shizwalo sheela. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.16.32",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.16.32"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "33",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 16:33"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "33",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hū ng'wene akūbeeja isangī kūlwa ipandī lyeela no no no, na kūlwa iheema lya kwibilingīla nū ng'walīlo, na a bagabīji, na a banhū pye a bose. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.16.33",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.16.33"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "34",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 16:34"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "34",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ī shenīshi shilī shilagīlo sha shikū jose kūlwa nguno ying'we. Būlī ng'waka līkūbeejiwa isangī kamò, kūlwa nguno ya shibi sha Baisilaeli pyī ī shose.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.16.34",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.16.34"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "34",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 16:34"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "34",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Na ng'hana īkīītwa gīt'ūmo SEEBA walī wanagīīlīla ū Musa.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.16.34",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.16.34"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    }
